00:21:10.450 --> 00:21:14.490
but it's really just adjusting what they say to fit in,

450
00:21:14.490 --> 00:21:16.810
it's not actually changing what they believe internally,

451
00:21:16.810 --> 00:21:18.870
and that's just basically flip flopping.

452
00:21:18.870 --> 00:21:21.330
Yeah, I think I fall mostly

453
00:21:21.330 --> 00:21:24.981
into the politicking camp as a--

454
00:21:24.981 --> 00:21:26.630
Really, as I'm surprised to hear you say that,

455
00:21:26.630 --> 00:21:28.360
really, why would you say that?

456
00:21:28.360 --> 00:21:30.530
Well, I would have guessed, just because of the way

457
00:21:30.530 --> 00:21:32.160
that you've inspired so many people,

458
00:21:32.160 --> 00:21:34.600
I would have guessed that preaching might be

459
00:21:34.600 --> 00:21:36.540
the default of those three for you.

460
00:21:36.540 --> 00:21:39.110
Preaching is very uncomfortable for me,

461
00:21:39.110 --> 00:21:42.390
I'm much more interested in approval

