00:21:42.390 --> 00:21:46.540
and being liked to a default, in a not so great way,

463
00:21:46.540 --> 00:21:50.910
like I've really made major life decisions based on approval

464
00:21:50.910 --> 00:21:52.440
or doing the socially accepted.

465
00:21:52.440 --> 00:21:54.940
I mean, I was a lawyer for over a decade,

466
00:21:54.940 --> 00:21:56.420
trying to jam a square peg

467
00:21:56.420 --> 00:21:58.710
into a round hole for way too long,

468
00:21:58.710 --> 00:22:01.480
and very reluctant to get out of it,

469
00:22:01.480 --> 00:22:04.580
out of fear of social repercussions

470
00:22:04.580 --> 00:22:07.830
and familial expectations and the like.

471
00:22:07.830 --> 00:22:12.830
And, you know, I would sit in depositions,

472
00:22:13.360 --> 00:22:16.580
or in hearings and just see the gray

473
00:22:16.580 --> 00:22:19.750
and everything and just felt like I'm a really bad advocate,

474
00:22:19.750 --> 00:22:22.870
because I really wanna appreciate the nuance

475
00:22:22.870 --> 00:22:24.740
and all of this and can't we just all get along?

476
00:22:24.740 --> 00:22:28.010
Like, I'm conflict averse, I'm a people pleaser.

