00:22:28.010 --> 00:22:29.950
And you know, I host these podcasts,

478
00:22:29.950 --> 00:22:33.030
and I wanna be challenging in the conversations, but also,

479
00:22:33.030 --> 00:22:35.750
I only have the people on that I respect and admire.

