00:23:08.300 --> 00:23:12.393
And I've spent a lot of time thinking about how I,

491
00:23:15.320 --> 00:23:18.520
embody that ethos, how I carry that message,

492
00:23:18.520 --> 00:23:22.440
how I advocate for something that I believe in,

493
00:23:22.440 --> 00:23:27.440
and I've realized that for my own personal makeup,

