I have zero interest in doing it.

1864
01:26:09.680 --> 01:26:13.720
And so systematically, I put off tasks that fall

1865
01:26:13.720 --> 01:26:16.360
in that rock solid, that two by two of interesting

1866
01:26:16.360 --> 01:26:18.550
and important and what understanding

1867
01:26:18.550 --> 01:26:20.030
that has helped me do, is to say,

1868
01:26:20.030 --> 01:26:24.170
Okay, I will put off reading a legal contract forever.

1869
01:26:24.170 --> 01:26:25.240
And it sounds like you do, too,

1870
01:26:25.240 --> 01:26:28.070
based on what your career was like,

1871
01:26:28.070 --> 01:26:29.760
it just bores the hell out of me.

1872
01:26:29.760 --> 01:26:31.680
And that means when I understand that,

1873
01:26:31.680 --> 01:26:34.470
I can manage it better, because I can try to make

1874
