who knows something about the law and say,

1876
01:26:39.307 --> 01:26:40.560
"Hey, would you be willing to chat

1877
01:26:40.560 --> 01:26:42.320
through a few of my questions as I read this?"

1878
01:26:42.320 --> 01:26:44.580
And I know I'm gonna be forced to read it in order to have

1879
