the conversation and not waste their time.

1880
01:26:46.820 --> 01:26:49.510
You have to recruit a co-conspirator into this.

1881
01:26:49.510 --> 01:26:52.470
Yeah, of course, I need an accountability buddy.

1882
01:26:52.470 --> 01:26:55.320
Exactly, somebody somebody to force me to get on task,

1883
01:26:55.320 --> 01:26:56.820
somebody to do what I would normally do

1884
01:26:56.820 --> 01:26:58.220
if this were a different task.

1885
01:26:58.220 --> 01:27:00.100
And then the other thing I'll do is I'll just try

1886
01:27:00.100 --> 01:27:01.937
to build into reward afterward and say,

1887
01:27:01.937 --> 01:27:05.410
"Look, if I finish reading this contract, then you know,

1888
01:27:05.410 --> 01:27:08.140
I get to watch my favorite show," which for years,

1889
