I had people who would actually delete those shows,

1890
01:27:10.820 --> 01:27:12.650
if I didn't live up to my promises.

1891
01:27:12.650 --> 01:27:14.250
First, it was college roommates.

1892
01:27:14.250 --> 01:27:17.870
And then, I think I remember asking my wife Allison

1893
01:27:17.870 --> 01:27:19.610
at some point, you know, can you just delete this

1894
01:27:19.610 --> 01:27:22.190
from the DVR because I didn't earn it today.

1895
01:27:22.190 --> 01:27:24.960
And that kind of self reward has been pretty motivating

1896
01:27:24.960 --> 01:27:27.690
from time to time, so that's a long answer.

1897
01:27:27.690 --> 01:27:29.780
But it's the framework that I found most useful

1898
01:27:29.780 --> 01:27:32.300
for navigating this dilemma in my own life.

1899
01:27:32.300 --> 01:27:34.070
How do you solve it?

1900
01:27:34.070 --> 01:27:36.983
Look at you coming back with the questions.

1901
01:27:36.983 --> 01:27:39.970
Yeah I wanna learn from you, come on this is I honestly,

