but I would say by and large,

1952
01:29:57.210 --> 01:30:01.250
like it's something I look forward to every day

1953
01:30:01.250 --> 01:30:03.676
and always have, like I got up, you know,

1954
01:30:03.676 --> 01:30:06.150
in high school I was getting up at 4:45

1955
01:30:06.150 --> 01:30:08.040
in the morning to go to swim practice like,

1956
01:30:08.040 --> 01:30:10.340
it was very goal oriented then in a way

1957
01:30:10.340 --> 01:30:13.190
that it isn't really now, it's more lifestyle,

1958
01:30:13.190 --> 01:30:16.820
but it brings it, I feel better,

1959
01:30:16.820 --> 01:30:18.690
I'm a better person when I'm doing it,

1960
01:30:18.690 --> 01:30:20.900
and I enjoy the process of doing it.

1961
01:30:20.900 --> 01:30:23.880
So the confusion lies in people thinking

1962
01:30:23.880 --> 01:30:27.090
that this is something that I hate,

1963
01:30:27.090 --> 01:30:30.270
and I do it anyway, which is not the case.

1964
01:30:30.270 --> 01:30:32.590
I buy that and I get it.

1965
01:30:32.590 --> 01:30:34.230
I think the mystery for me though,

1966
01:30:34.230 --> 01:30:36.850
is there are moments when you're clearly not

1967
