01:30:39.160 --> 01:30:40.940
So I'll give you a concrete example.

1969
01:30:40.940 --> 01:30:45.940
Which is we done I think it was like we did an 11 hour hike,

1970
01:30:45.980 --> 01:30:48.350
and then we did I don't know it's about,

1971
01:30:48.350 --> 01:30:52.180
maybe a mile now is a kilometer swim across the cold lake.

1972
01:30:52.180 --> 01:30:55.270
And then we're doing this intense mountain bike ride

1973
01:30:55.270 --> 01:30:58.950
that I've just, I don't know how I'm gonna do this.

1974
01:30:58.950 --> 01:31:02.820
And I'm guessing from what the changes I made nutritionally

1975
01:31:02.820 --> 01:31:04.950
over the next few days for the next bike ride,

1976
01:31:04.950 --> 01:31:09.690
