And I've never felt that in my life.

1982
01:31:21.640 --> 01:31:25.130
I've always been the person who persists no matter what.

1983
01:31:25.130 --> 01:31:28.550
And coming face to face with that wall and saying,

1984
01:31:28.550 --> 01:31:31.380
I literally don't think I can do it physically,

1985
01:31:31.380 --> 01:31:33.460
you've pushed through that wall, how?

1986
01:31:33.460 --> 01:31:36.270
Sure, well, first of all, let's finish this thread,

1987
01:31:36.270 --> 01:31:38.550
so you did persist, right?

1988
01:31:38.550 --> 01:31:41.610
So you did take another pedal stroke, and you didn't die?

1989
01:31:41.610 --> 01:31:43.150
Yeah, but I had to pause for a minute.

1990
01:31:43.150 --> 01:31:45.130
And I was like, no, I don't wanna pause,

1991
01:31:45.130 --> 01:31:46.570
I don't wanna have to rest.

1992
01:31:46.570 --> 01:31:48.690
But you finished the challenge?

1993
01:31:48.690 --> 01:31:49.713
Yeah, actually.

