Oh, no, definitely not, not a chance,

2005
01:32:23.202 --> 01:32:25.320
I only get it when working out.

2006
01:32:25.320 --> 01:32:27.320
But you can recall it.

2007
01:32:27.320 --> 01:32:28.360
I remember it.
In a way.

2008
01:32:28.360 --> 01:32:31.030
And also, yeah, I can remember

