01:41:42.880 --> 01:41:46.260
It does the, I think right away about this work

2212
01:41:46.260 --> 01:41:49.570
in consumer psychology by Friestad and Wright,

2213
01:41:49.570 --> 01:41:50.570
where they talk about,

2214
01:41:50.570 --> 01:41:52.550
