2238
01:42:53.080 --> 01:42:55.990
And then the second question I wanna ask is,

2239
01:42:55.990 --> 01:42:58.510
whatever values we agree upon,

2240
01:42:58.510 --> 01:43:02.003
is there anything I can learn about or inquire about,

2241
01:43:02.003 --> 01:43:06.860
that will help the other person better clarify those values,

2242
01:43:06.860 --> 01:43:09.020
